view: data
table media(role)
table source(input -> media)

Upload two files
  + media m1   role: upload
  + media m2   role: upload
  + media tmp  role: scratch
  - media tmp

Drop the first
  - media m1

Upload it again
  + media m1   role: upload

Replace the second in one step
  - media m2
  + media m2   role: audio

Point at it
  + source s1  input: m2

Nothing changes
